        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bel_Aire%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Bel Aire officially incorporated on November 26, 1980 after a two‑year legal battle that ended with the Kansas Supreme Court ruling in its favor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
