      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bel_Aire%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bel Aire sits north of the East Fork of Chisholm Creek, about 6 miles northeast in the Great Plains.",
